{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <p><strong>10. \u301c\u9593\uff08\u3042\u3044\u3060\uff09<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:69.29%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li>\u590f\u4f11\u307f\u306e<strong><u>\u9593<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u65c5\u884c\u3059\u308b\u3064\u3082\u308a\u3067\u3059\u3002<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">(T\u00f4i d\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ebd \u0111i du l\u1ecbch trong k\u00ec ngh\u1ec9 h\u00e8.)<\/p><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li>\u304a\u6bcd\u3055\u3093\u304c\u5bdd\u3066\u3044\u308b<strong><u>\u9593<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u5b50\u4f9b\u305f\u3061\u306f\u30c6\u30ec\u30d3\u3092\u898b\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;(M\u1ea5y \u0111\u1ee9a tr\u1ebb xem tivi trong l\u00fac m\u1eb9 \u0111ang ng\u1ee7.)<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/u><\/p><p><i><strong>Trong khi\u2026<\/strong><\/i><\/p><p>Di\u1ec5n t\u1ea3 h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3 di\u1ec5n ra li\u00ean t\u1ee5c trong su\u1ed1t kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian n\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3.&nbsp;<\/p><p><u>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/u><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:51.12%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>&nbsp;N\u306e\u30fbV\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u9593\uff08\u3042\u3044\u3060\uff09\u3001\u301c<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Unit 15\u30fb\u8a9e\u5f59\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\uff0825\u500b\uff09<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:77.16%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:31.66%;\"><col style=\"width:31.78%;\"><col style=\"width:36.5